{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_05FD50","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"你看过《瑟堡的雨伞》吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":36,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"电影？不，没看过。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":27,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"不知道？虽然是10年前的电影，但主演Catherine Deneuve真的太迷人了！还有那些歌！服装！色彩！真让人受不了！","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":145,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"这样啊。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":12,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"故事发生在瑟堡这座军港。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":36,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"诺曼底登陆时作为登陆据点的港口吧。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":51,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"故事发生在年轻男人被征召去参加阿尔及利亚战争的年代。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":78,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"不过法国政府坚持说那不是战争，而是“北非的秩序维持行动”。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":87,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"我那时还是孩子，不过隐约记得认识的一个大哥哥出征了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":78,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"法国实行义务兵役制。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":30,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"那场战争拆散了一对相爱的年轻人。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":48,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"Jacques Demy导演写的歌词和Michel Legrand的音乐，深深刺进了我的心。直到现在，那段旋律还一直萦绕在脑海里！","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":143,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"啊……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":12,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"没事吧？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":12,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"它会改变人生，改变命运。战争不是好事。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":57,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":15,"cn_text":"嗯。听你这样的<R=女人,PERSON>说出来，不知为什么特别触动人心。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=女人,PERSON>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":86,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"}]}